{#
  An entry includes it with `read` on the context; a listing sets it from the
  entry it is printing. Nothing is printed for a post that read nothing.
  `read.line` is the sentence the feeds and the federated Note carry too, with
  p-read-status and a p-read-of h-cite; a theme wanting other markup has
  `read.status`, `read.statusLabel` and `read.of` to build it from.
#}
{% if read %}{{ read.line | safe }}{% endif %}
